{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04192","headline":"同辛簿简仰酬思玄上人林泉四首 四 · 骆宾王","name":"同辛簿简仰酬思玄上人林泉四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俗远风尘隔，春还初服迟。\n林疑中散地，人似上皇时。\n芳杜湘君曲，幽兰楚客词。\n山中有春草，长似寄相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}